-- LOCAL data (no external API on the hot path). ON CONFLICT (food_key) DO NOTHING
-- keeps the existing hand-curated common foods (incl. Chinese display names).
-- Source: https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/ SR Legacy 2018-04 (public domain).
